"description":"Introducing the AtoB App – the transportation industry’s solution to unlocking big discounts on fuel.\n\nHere’s what you can expect:\n\n- Fuel Discounts: Find discounts on truck diesel averaging 42¢ off per gallon at the stations you fuel at most including TA, Petro, TA Express, 7-Eleven, Speedway, RaceTrac, and more. Enjoy discounts averaging 5¢ off per gallon of unleaded fuel at stations like Speedway, 7-Eleven, Casey’s, Kwik Trip, Chevron, and more.\n- AtoB FuelMap: Plan routes with stops at the stations with the highest discounts and lowest retail cost of fuel – ensuring maximum savings before you ever leave home.\n- Seamless Navigation: Start navigating your fuel-cost-optimized route in the navigation app of your choice in just one click.\n- Fleet Management: Set custom controls like spend limits, operational hours, blacklist and whitelist merchants, and more. Activate and deactivate cards, pay balances, and manage the full scope of your fleet’s finances within the AtoB App.\n- Secure Card Unlock: When it’s time to fuel, unlock your card from the AtoB App - ensuring cards are useless in the hands of anyone else.", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"129289216", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2416, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.68170999999999981611153998528607189655303955078125, "genreIds":["6010", "6002"], "price":0.00, "trackId":1618855693, "trackName":"AtoB: Find and Save on Fuel", "userRatingCount":2416}, 
